      "created_at": "2023-05-13T16:33:44.925Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\" data-post=\"2\" data-topic=\"30056\" data-full=\"true\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The real fun of this one was getting to experience a Farside City that can’t do anything to you because <em>checks notes</em> there are some computers.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Obviously the computers are helping to maintain all of the Presever tech.</p>\n<p>But yeah, Farside is hilariously vulnerable to the Wraith. All of its hostile effects seem to be “small amounts of damage, but to everyone.”</p>",
